ositioning"},{"type":"flow","items":["BASLP","Research Internship/Dissertation","Clinical Research Assistant","Research Coordinator/Associate","Specialized Clinical Researcher","Research Manager / PhD / Principal Investigator"]},{"type":"p","text":"For the strongest long-term profile, combine BASLP clinical expertise + research methodology + biostatistics + GCP + scientific writing + clinical data management + R/Python + evidence-based practice + AI/digital-health research. This creates a strong interdisciplinary profile for audiology and speech-language research, clinical trials, medical-device development, rehabilitation research, public-health studies and academic research."}]}]}